{"v":4,"catch":"跨越平行世界的戰鬥！","desc":"《WARP & WARP》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1981 年推出的動作遊戲。玩家在前進的過程中穿梭於兩個世界：用槍戰鬥的太空世界，以及與時間戰鬥的迷宮世界炸彈。透過擊倒在設定條件下產生的MYSTERY BEM，或透過一次爆炸消滅多個敵人來嘗試獲得高分！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-11-22","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/abc731256419b1bc2727a1418d19b0e5ccaaf66e002fa47cb9ad8469b862a345.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/be5397f2bb429346f76f33cb4daa7b97605a1a9eb68b0c8d2acc30e28009a4f4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54741e1fc77783816460aa714d92254b29671587f997bb28cb83a7f31bbd2637.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/965ae9f1323e79fb5cf2b8a4265eddf962c0dc4f99661e35a8d0a42aaf2d0a57.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54b235b967c2a6694dead810781c46607020fcb7ea58afbfbd13d2728e2a5e5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8e1c9db8e64dda54065fcbc7eceb23cf3adf9f4e80930cf7e4b0e1b90f95781f.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a69019630000","dlc":[]}